{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00773",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.85,
      "end_seconds": 11.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Hi. My eyes feel, I don't know, dry and gritty. Mostly when I'm on my computer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.74,
      "end_seconds": 18.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "How long has that been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.28,
      "end_seconds": 30.62,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "Months, probably. It's been getting worse. By the end of the day they're burning, and I'm squinting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.73,
      "end_seconds": 37.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Does it affect both eyes? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.16,
      "end_seconds": 49.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "Both. Sometimes they water a lot, which is weird, because they feel dry. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.14,
      "end_seconds": 62.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "That's actually very common, the eye waters because it's irritated. How many hours a day are you on screens? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.62,
      "end_seconds": 73.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "Eight or nine at work, and then I'm on my phone in the evening. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.4,
      "end_seconds": 84.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "When you look at a screen, do you notice how often you blink? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.97,
      "end_seconds": 93.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "I never thought about it. Probably not much. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.11,
      "end_seconds": 104.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "Most people blink about half as often when they concentrate on a screen. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.08,
      "end_seconds": 111.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Really? So that's why. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.87,
      "end_seconds": 122.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "It's a big part of it. Your tear film dries out between blinks. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.14,
      "end_seconds": 130.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Is it serious? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.1,
      "end_seconds": 143.36,
      "duration_seconds": 9.26,
      "text": "Not at all. It's called digital eye strain with dry eye, and it's very treatable without any tests. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.43,
      "end_seconds": 149.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Do I need glasses? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.26,
      "end_seconds": 158.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "When did you last have your eyes tested? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.06,
      "end_seconds": 165.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Er, maybe three years ago. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.58,
      "end_seconds": 176.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Book a check-up at your optician, because uncorrected vision makes eye strain worse. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.41,
      "end_seconds": 182.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "I'll do that. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.94,
      "end_seconds": 197.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.9,
      "text": "In the meantime, follow the twenty-twenty-twenty rule: every twenty minutes, look at something twenty feet away for twenty seconds."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.12,
      "end_seconds": 204.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I've heard of that one. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.67,
      "end_seconds": 216.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "And blink deliberately, fully, a few times each minute, particularly when you're reading. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.57,
      "end_seconds": 221.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.26,
      "end_seconds": 233.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "Make sure your screen is slightly below eye level, and about an arm's length away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.44,
      "end_seconds": 240.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Mine's above my head, practically. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.22,
      "end_seconds": 255.08,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "Then lower it. And if your office has air conditioning blowing at your face, move away from it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.67,
      "end_seconds": 262.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Good point, it's right above me. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.87,
      "end_seconds": 273.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "A warm compress on your closed eyes for a few minutes in the evening helps as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.27,
      "end_seconds": 279.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Warm flannel. Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.31,
      "end_seconds": 293.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.35,
      "text": "If you get pain, redness, or blurred vision that doesn't clear when you blink, see your optician urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.14,
      "end_seconds": 299.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "I will. Thanks. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.71,
      "end_seconds": 306.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Take care. ~"
    }
  ]
}
